ProtectedRoute.jsx आणि AdminOnly.jsx यांतील फरक
ProtectedRoute user login केलेला आहे का हे तपासते. त्यात adminOnly prop दिल्यास Admin permission देखील तपासली जाते.
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
A. Home आणि Products
Files: app/page.jsx, app/product/page.jsx, app/product/[slug]/page.jsx, components/ProductCard.jsx
Action				API request
Home categories			GET /api/products?categories=Fashion
Electronics				GET /api/products?categories=electronics
Home & Kitchen			GET /api/products?categories=Home%20%26%20Kitchen (URL encoding नुसार)
Search / Pagination		GET /api/products/search?page=1&limit=5&title=...
Product details			GET /api/products/{slug}

B. Authentication
File: context/AuthContext.jsx
Register		POST /api/account/register
Login			POST /api/account/login
Current user	GET /api/account/me
Logout			POST /api/account/logout
Refresh attempt	POST /api/account/refresh

C. Cart आणि Checkout
Files: app/cart/page.jsx, app/checkout/page.jsx, app/product/[slug]/page.jsx
Add product				POST /api/carts/add
Read cart				GET /api/carts
Increase quantity		PATCH /api/carts/increase/{product_id}
Decrease quantity		PATCH /api/carts/decrease/{product_id}
Remove item				DELETE /api/carts/delete/{item_id}
Load addresses			GET /api/shippings/addresses
Checkout				POST /api/orders/checkout

D. User आणि Admin panel
Files: app/user/ मधील संबंधित pages
Orders				GET /api/orders
Cancel order		PATCH /api/orders/cancel/{id}
Payment history		GET /api/payments
Address CRUD		/api/shippings/addresses वरील GET, POST, PATCH, DELETE
Category CRUD		/api/products-category वरील GET, POST, DELETE
Admin products		/api/products वरील GET, POST, PATCH, DELETE
Shipping status		GET /api/orders/admin/all, PATCH /api/shippings/status/{orderId}
